# Xref lane

Source SHA-256: `HASH`

Resolve every indexed internal reference against the listed targets. Distinguish internal references from statutes and rules. Use display_note_to_block and each note's display_number; never treat a raw FN block ID as a displayed note number.
Return `lane-results/xref.json` using the lane-result schema.

```json
{
  "headings": [],
  "captions": [],
  "notes": [
    {
      "block_id": "FN1",
      "display_number": 1,
      "story": "footnote"
    }
  ],
  "display_note_to_block": {
    "1": "FN1"
  },
  "cross_references": [
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "block_id": "FN1",
      "targets": [
        "FN1"
      ],
      "excerpt": ""
    }
  ],
  "bookmarks": [],
  "fields": []
}
```

